WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.081
Open the voice agent and select Tools

00:00:04.081 --> 00:00:06.193
Open the On-call tab

00:00:06.193 --> 00:00:10.746
Expand Integration and pick WhatsApp Business

00:00:10.746 --> 00:00:13.577
Two tools: Send WhatsApp Template and Send WhatsApp Text

00:00:13.577 --> 00:00:16.617
Text is free-form, inside the 24-hour window only

00:00:16.617 --> 00:00:20.067
Choose the sender; leave Send to blank for the customer

00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:23.714
Pick the template

00:00:23.714 --> 00:00:34.698
Map each body variable to a custom variable

00:00:34.698 --> 00:00:38.228
Add test value gives a variable a sample for Run test

00:00:38.228 --> 00:00:44.340
Click Run test, then Import

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:45.764
The tool appears in the On-call list

00:00:45.764 --> 00:00:52.109
Post-call: the template is sent after every conversation

00:00:52.109 --> 00:00:59.315
Only Send WhatsApp Template is offered post-call

00:00:59.315 --> 00:01:08.707
Named variables get rows with their names

00:01:08.707 --> 00:01:11.635
Click Import

00:01:11.635 --> 00:01:14.239
Each send shows as a tool call in Logs
